{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://hk.on.cc/hk/bkn/cnt/intnews/20261119/photo/bkn-20261119163610957-1119_00992_001_01p.jpg?20261119165811\"/><p>克里米亞大橋再次受襲。</p><p>俄羅斯交通部周四（19日）表示，周三（18日）晚上發生無人機襲擊事件後，克里米亞大橋鐵路段列車通行已暫停。</p><p>聲明說，襲擊未造成傷亡，受損情況正在評估中。克里米亞地區行政長官阿克肖諾夫證實，克里米亞大橋再次受到襲擊，交通已中斷。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-19T09:14:56.363177+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":1,"source":"東網 國際","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-19T08:36:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-19T10:45:55.426458+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-19T09:08:20.644169+00:00","content_hash":"6ad9156e0d70fdaba9d880a46df2a5f4589542fa9bb81bc2f8e220b1b9b24788","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}